                        "content": "The acute angle $\\alpha$ between two lines with known slopes $m_1$ and $m_2$ is determined using the following formula: $\\tan(\\alpha) = \\left| \\frac{m_2 - m_1}{1 + m_1 \\cdot m_2} \\right|$."
