                        "content": "$\\frac{dr}{dt} = \\frac{dV/dt}{4\\pi r^2} = \\frac{100}{4\\pi (5)^2} = \\frac{100}{100\\pi} = \\frac{1}{\\pi} \\text{ cm/s}$."
