                        "content": "$\\bar{x} \\pm t_{\\alpha/2, n-1} \\cdot \\dfrac{s}{\\sqrt{n}} = 80 \\pm 2.064 \\cdot \\dfrac{10}{\\sqrt{25}} = 80 \\pm 4.128$."
