                        "title": "Break-Even Formula",
                        "content": "$Q_{BE} = \\frac{\\text{Fixed Cost}}{\\text{Price} - \\text{Variable Cost}} = \\frac{50{,}000}{45 - 20} = \\frac{50{,}000}{25} = 2{,}000\\ \\text{units}$"
