                        "title": "Calculate Total Work Done",
                        "content": "$W = \\Delta K = \\frac{1}{2}m(v_2^2 - v_1^2) = \\frac{1}{2}(1500)(30^2 - 10^2) = 600,000 \\text{ J}$."
