                    {
                        "title": "Calculate Buckling Load",
                        "content": "$P_{cr} = \\dfrac{\\pi^2 E I}{L_e^2} = \\dfrac{\\pi^2 \\cdot 200,000 \\cdot 1.25 \\times 10^7}{3150^2} \\approx 2,486,897 \\text{ N}$."
                    }
