                        "title": "Max Deflection",
                        "content": "$\\delta_{max} = \\dfrac{5wL^4}{384EI} = \\dfrac{5 \\times 20000 \\times 4^4}{384 \\times 200 \\times 10^9 \\times 50 \\times 10^{-6}} = \\dfrac{5 \\times 20000 \\times 256}{384 \\times 10^7} \\approx 0.004$ m = 4 mm."
