                        "title": "Thermal Stress",
                        "content": "$\\sigma = E \\alpha \\Delta T = (200 \\times 10^9)(12 \\times 10^{-6})(50) = 120 \\times 10^6$ Pa = 120 MPa. Since expansion is prevented, the stress is compressive."
