                        "title": "Calculate the Temperature Ratio",
                        "content": "Substitute the values: $\\dfrac{T_0}{250} = 1 + \\dfrac{1.4 - 1}{2} (2.0)^2 = 1 + (0.2)(4) = 1.8$."
