            "question": "In an AC circuit, the voltage and current are given by $v(t) = 170 \\sin(377t + 30^\\circ)\\ \\text{V}$ and $i(t) = 10 \\sin(377t - 15^\\circ)\\ \\text{A}$. What is the average power (real power) delivered to the circuit?",
