                        "content": "$F = k\\frac{q_1 q_2}{r^2} = 8.99\\times10^9 \\times \\frac{2\\times10^{-6} \\times 3\\times10^{-6}}{(0.1)^2} = 8.99\\times10^9 \\times \\frac{6\\times10^{-12}}{0.01} = 5.39\\ \\text{N}$"
