                        "title": "Isothermal Work Formula",
                        "content": "$W = mRT ln(V_2/V_1) = 0.5 \times 0.287 \times 300 \times ln(0.4/0.1) = 43.05 \times ln(4) = 43.05 \times 1.3863 = 59.7\text{ kJ}$."
