                        "content": "$\\dot{Q} = 0.5 \\text{ kg/s} \\times 1.005 \\text{ kJ/kg}\\cdot\\text{K} \\times (35 - 15) = 0.5 \\times 1.005 \\times 20 = 10.05 \\text{ kW}$."
