                        "title": "Identify the Minimum Bound",
                        "content": "During peak hourly demand periods, the pressure will drop due to high friction losses, but it must not fall below a minimum acceptable threshold, which is universally established as 35 psi for normal operation to ensure adequate service to multistory buildings."
