            "title": "Critical Stress vs. Slenderness",
            "question": "When the slenderness ratio KL/r of a steel column exceeds the limiting value separating elastic from inelastic buckling (approximately 4.71√(E/Fy) per AISC), which formula governs the critical stress?",
