                        "title": "AISC Column Curve",
                        "content": "For long, slender columns where $KL/r > 4.71\\sqrt{E/F_y}$, elastic buckling controls and the Euler formula $F_{cr} = \\frac{\\pi^2 E}{(KL/r)^2}$ applies. Short columns use the inelastic (Johnson) formula."
