                    {
                        "title": "Integrate Impulse Response",
                        "content": "$H(0) = \\int_{0}^{\\infty} e^{-2t}\\, dt = \\left[ -\\frac{1}{2} e^{-2t} \\right]_{0}^{\\infty} = 0 - \\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) = 0.5$"
                    }
