                        "content": "$L = 1.0 \\times 10^{-6}\\text{ H/m}$\n$C = 100 \\times 10^{-12}\\text{ F/m}$\n$\\frac{L}{C} = \\frac{10^{-6}}{10^{-10}} = 10^4$\n$Z_0 = \\sqrt{10^4} = 100.0\\text{ \\Omega}$."
