            "title": "Absorption Tower Height from NTU and HTU",
            "question": "An industrial gas absorber is designed to remove carbon dioxide from a gas stream. The height of a transfer unit based on the gas phase is $H_G = 0.65\\text{ m}$, and the number of transfer units required is $N_G = 6.2$. What is the overall height of the packed bed?",
