            "title": "Chronic Daily Intake - Case 32",
            "question": "What is the Chronic Daily Intake (CDI) in mg/(kg\\cdot day) for a $70$ kg adult drinking $2.0$ L/day of water containing $0.320$ mg/L of a toxic chemical?",
